      "text": [
        "ه عن محمّد بن حسّان فقد رويته عن أبي؛ و محمّد بن الحسن؛ و الحسين بن أحمد بن إدريس- رضي اللّه عنهم- عن أحمد بن إدريس، عن محمّد بن حسّان‌."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "And whatever is narrated from Muhammad ibn Hassan, I have narrated it from my father, and from Muhammad ibn Al-Hasan, and from Al-Husayn ibn Ahmad ibn Idris - may Allah (swt) be pleased with them - from Ahmad ibn Idris, from Muhammad ibn Hassan."
        ]
      }
